(o)
"UGC" means the University Grants Commission established under the University Grants Commission Act, 1956;
(p)
"University" means the Himgiri Nabh Vishwavidyalaya (University in the Sky) established under this Act;

(i)
to make appointments of the faculty, officers and employees of the University or a constituent college. Regional Centres,
Study Centres and Zed Career Academy Centres;
(j)
to receive donations and gifts of any Kind and to acquire, hold, manage, maintain and dispose of any movable or
immovable property, including trust and endowment properties for the purpose of the University or a constituent college,
or a Regional Centre, Study Centre and Zed Career Academy Centre with the prior permission of TALEEM Research
Foundation, Ahmedabad;
(k)
to institute and maintain halls and to recognize places of residence for students of the University or a constituent college;
(l)
to supervise and control and residence, and to regulate the discipline among the students and all categories of
employees and to lay down the conditions of service of such employees, including their Code of Conduct;
(m)
to create Academic, Administrative, and support staff and other necessary posts;
